sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as 调用方
    participant D as RouterDispatcher
    participant R as RouterResolver
    participant O as RouterObserver
    participant H as RouterLostHandler
    participant F as 兜底路由

    C->>D: start(未知 URI)
    D->>R: resolve(request)
    R-->>D: NotFound
    D->>O: onEvent(NotFoundDetected)
    D->>H: handle(lostContext)
    alt 未恢复
        H-->>D: NotHandled
        D->>O: onFinished(NotFoundEvent)
        D-->>C: RouterResult.NotFound
    else 以兜底 URI 恢复
        H-->>D: Redirect(/404)
        D->>D: 校验重定向次数与环路
        D->>F: 执行 /404
        F-->>D: Completed
        D->>O: onFinished(Completed, traceId)
        D-->>C: RouterResult.Ok（含 finalUri）
    else 兜底处理失败
        H-->>D: Failed(cause)
        D->>O: onFinished(FailedEvent)
        D-->>C: RouterResult.Failed
    end
